*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% uniFLOW IPP Server PPD for Linux
*% Adapted from NT-ware ipp-ufo.ppd for CUPS on Linux
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "2.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*FileSystem: False
*cupsVersion: 2.0
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsSNMPSupplies: False
*APAirPrint: True
*APAirPrintVersion: 1.6
*APURFVersion: 1.4
*APPrinterFWVersion: "uniFLOW:uniFLOW Online Server"
*cupsLanguages: "en"
*PCFileName: "UNIFLOW-IPP.PPD"
*ModelName: "uniFLOW IPP"
*Product: (UniFlowIPP)
*ShortNickName: "uniFLOW IPP"
*Manufacturer: "uniFLOW"
*NickName: "uniFLOW Secure Print"
*Throughput: 35
*cupsSingleFile: True
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-pdf application/pdf 0 maxsize(6400000000) -"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-pdf 0 -"
*cupsMaxCopies: 9999
*OpenUI *Collate: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Collate
*DefaultCollate: False
*Collate True: "<</Collate true>>setpagedevice"
*Collate False: "<</Collate false>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Collate
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 18/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel RGB/Color: "<</cupsColorSpace 19/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*DefaultResolution: 300x300dpi
*OpenUI *cupsPrintQuality/Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *cupsPrintQuality
*DefaultcupsPrintQuality: Normal
*cupsPrintQuality Normal: "<</cupsInteger1 4 /HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *cupsPrintQuality
*cupsBackSide: Normal
*OpenUI *Duplex/2-Sided Printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: DuplexNoTumble
*Duplex None/Off (1-Sided): "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long-Edge (Portrait): "<</Duplex true/Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short-Edge (Landscape): "<</Duplex true/Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex
*DefaultOutputOrder: Normal
*OpenUI *StapleLocation/Staple: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *StapleLocation
*DefaultStapleLocation: None
*StapleLocation None/None: ""
*StapleLocation SinglePortrait/Staple (Portrait): ""
*StapleLocation SingleLandscape/Staple (Landscape): ""
*StapleLocation SingleRevPortrait/Staple (Reverse Portrait): ""
*StapleLocation SingleRevLandscape/Staple (Reverse Landscape): ""
*StapleLocation DualLandscape/2 Staple (Landscape): ""
*StapleLocation DualPortrait/2 Staple (Portrait): ""
*StapleLocation SaddleStitch/Saddle Stitch: ""
*cupsIPPFinishings 20/staple-top-left: "*StapleLocation SinglePortrait"
*cupsIPPFinishings 21/staple-bottom-left: "*StapleLocation SingleRevLandscape"
*cupsIPPFinishings 22/staple-top-right: "*StapleLocation SingleLandscape"
*cupsIPPFinishings 23/staple-bottom-right: "*StapleLocation SingleRevPortrait"
*cupsIPPFinishings 28/staple-dual-left: "*StapleLocation DualPortrait"
*cupsIPPFinishings 29/staple-dual-top: "*StapleLocation DualLandscape"
*cupsIPPFinishings 8/saddle-stitch: "*StapleLocation SaddleStitch"
*CloseUI: *StapleLocation
*OpenUI *PunchMedia/Punch: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PunchMedia
*DefaultPunchMedia: None
*PunchMedia None/None: ""
*PunchMedia DualPortrait/2-Hole (Portrait): ""
*cupsIPPFinishings 74/punch-dual-left: "*PunchMedia DualPortrait"
*PunchMedia TriplePortrait/3-Hole (Portrait): ""
*cupsIPPFinishings 78/punch-triple-left: "*PunchMedia TriplePortrait"
*PunchMedia QuadPortrait/4-Hole (Portrait): ""
*cupsIPPFinishings 82/punch-quad-left: "*PunchMedia QuadPortrait"
*CloseUI: *PunchMedia
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Tabloid/11x17: "<</PageSize[792 1224]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A3/A3: "<</PageSize[842 1191]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/B5_JIS: "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Tabloid/11x17: "<</PageSize[792 1224]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A3/A3: "<</PageSize[842 1191]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5/B5_JIS: "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*ImageableArea Letter/Letter: "12.00 12.12 598.00 780.00"
*ImageableArea Legal/Legal:  "12.00 12.12 600.00 996.00"
*ImageableArea Tabloid/11x17: "12.0 12.0 780.00 1212.00"
